  Grype 0.119.0      Anchore, Apache-2.0, with Syft 1.52.0 inside (Apache-2.0).
                     ghcr.io/anchore/grype (the same image as docker.io/anchore/grype:v0.119.0).
                     Source: https://github.com/anchore/grype
